  DEFENDING ARMY

  Samantha led her armies into the fray.  No generals were present to lead 
the forces of Uga-Buga Makumb.
  A bad omen appeared, which of course dealt a severe blow to Samantha's 
hopes.  Samantha's mount was shot and killed from under Samantha.  As the 
struggle developed, the tactical wit of the acting commander and Samantha 
appeared evenly matched.

  Across the whole front, the 115th Fleet Marines were arrayed against the 
Veteran 270th Bowmen.  The 115th Fleet Marines fought with the 270th Bowmen 
and were easily beaten by the enemy.
  The forces of the acting commander broke through and were victorious.  The 
270th Bowmen demolished the 115th Fleet Marines.
  The defenders defeated Samantha's forces and drove them out of the 
Buccaneer Sea.  Her forces completely destroyed, Samantha fled frightened 
and alone to the Amazonian Sea.
  With the coming of the early summer season Samantha wasn't in the 
Buccaneer Sea so she utilized her spying skills to secretly keep track of 
happenings in the Amazonian Sea and reported the following.  The province of 
the Amazonian Sea owes allegiance to Cosmic Herderer Mugai.  Listening to 
the stories of wanderers, one can deduce the rulership of surrounding 
provinces: Kabompo- Mugai.
  Approximate Taxation: 4
  There were no conspicuous characters or forces in the Amazonian Sea.
  Samantha also kept tabs on the characters in the Amazonian Sea and any 
further news is in the General Intelligence Report.  Her experience raised 
her prowess in Spying.

  Midsummer's night came and went and late summer came.  Samantha wasn't in 
the Buccaneer Sea so she covertly spied on the Amazonian Sea and collected 
the following information:.  The province of the Amazonian Sea owes 
allegiance to Cosmic Herderer Mugai.  Listening to the stories of wanderers 
and merchants, one can deduce the rulership of surrounding areas: Kabompo- 
Mugai.
  Approximate Taxation: 4
  There were no conspicuous characters or forces in the Amazonian Sea.
  Samantha also kept tabs on the characters in the Amazonian Sea and any 
further news is in the General Intelligence Report.

  The summer mellowed into fall.  Samantha wasn't in the Buccaneer Sea so 
she conducted espionage in the Amazonian Sea and compiled this report.  The 
province of the Amazonian Sea owes allegiance to Cosmic Herderer Mugai.  
Listening to the gossip of travellers, one can deduce the rulership of 
surrounding areas: Kabompo- Mugai.
  Approximate Taxation: 4
  There were no conspicuous characters or forces in the Amazonian Sea.
  Samantha also kept tabs on the characters in the Amazonian Sea and any 
further news is in the General Intelligence Report.

  In early winter, Samantha invented nothing valuable in her sagely 
experiments.

  Thy humble servant,   Berthier, Squire to Samantha


